          "text": "Thank you for raising this perspective. Cape Verde’s history is certainly not only a story of beautiful landscapes and culture—it is also deeply connected to slavery, colonialism, exploitation, and painful inequalities that affected generations of African people, especially women.\nThe intention of this video was not to erase or minimize that history, but to also show how Cape Verdeans built a distinct culture and society from an extremely difficult past. I agree that celebrating the country today should never require forgetting the suffering that helped shape its history.",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-14T09:23:13Z"
